lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOn the first day at the new school, Xiao Yang says to his classmate Xiao Liu sitting next to him: \"My mom is a lady in our school cafeteria.\" Xiao Liu says: \"What a coincidence.\" At this time, another classmate Xiao Li comes over and says: \"I think the food in our school cafeteria is very delicious.\" Xiao Yang smiles and says: \"Yes, my mom cooks very well.\" Xiao Liu says: \"Xiao Li, do you want to go to the game room together?\" Xiao Li says: \"Sure, let's go together.\"\n\n[Question]\nIf there is, which sentence is inappropriate?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. My mom is an aunt in our school cafeteria.\nB. Yes, my mom cooks great.\nC. There is no inappropriate sentence.\nD. I think the food in our school cafeteria is very delicious.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":5,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0015011353086189683,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66f9bf4429d1fd72f6db6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535323760,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:02:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"5db1151ccef342abba8f0dce351d70fd"}